[en.FOCUS_C02_ARMY_MILITARIZATION]
Ponyville Militarization

[en.FOCUS_C02_ARMY_MILITARIZATION_desc]
War has finally given us a good excuse to openly push for Ponyville’s militarization. However, resistance is not only from the Empire, but also from Trixie’s election promises.\nTrixie promised Ponyville a future of peace and prosperity, and so far she seems to have delivered. But now that war has come, how much support can she still get?

[zh.FOCUS_C02_ARMY_MILITARIZATION]
小马谷军事化

[zh.FOCUS_C02_ARMY_MILITARIZATION_desc]
战争终于给了我们一个足够的借口来光明正大推动小马谷的军事化。然而，阻力并不完全来自于帝国，还有特丽克西当年的竞选承诺。\n特丽克西承诺了小马谷一个和平与繁荣的未来，到目前为止她似乎也真做到了。但是战争终究到来，她还能获得多少支持呢？

